      "source_id": "unreconciled:step-q143303",
      "problem": "Given that ${X}_{1},{X}_{2},…,{X}_{16}∼N(-3,{8}^{2})$ is a random sample of size $16$ from a normal population, calculate $P(|\\overset{―}{X}|>0.5).$\n\n*Hint: Value tables of $Φ(z)$ for different values of $z$ are given below, where $Φ(z)$ is the cumulative distribution function for the standard normal distribution. *\n\n| | $z$ | $\\,0.04\\,$ | $\\,0.05\\,$ | $\\,0.06\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\,1.2\\,$ | $\\,0.8925\\,$ | $\\,0.8944\\,$ | $\\,0.8962\\,$ |\n| $\\,1.3\\,$ | $\\,0.9099\\,$ | $\\,0.9115\\,$ | $\\,0.9131\\,$ |\n| $\\,1.4\\,$ | $\\,0.9251\\,$ | $\\,0.9265\\,$ | $\\,0.9279\\,$ | |  | | $z$ | $\\,0.05\\,$ | $\\,0.06\\,$ | $\\,0.07\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\,1.6\\,$ | $\\,0.9505\\,$ | $\\,0.9515\\,$ | $\\,0.9525\\,$ |\n| $\\,1.7\\,$ | $\\,0.9599\\,$ | $\\,0.9608\\,$ | $\\,0.9616\\,$ |\n| $\\,1.8\\,$ | $\\,0.9678\\,$ | $\\,0.9686\\,$ | $\\,0.9693\\,$ | |\n| --- | --- | --- |",
      "worked_solution": "If ${X}_{1},{X}_{2},…,{X}_{n}$ is a random sample of size $n$ from a normal population, where \n\n$$\n{X}_{i}∼N(\\mu ,{\\sigma }^{2}),\\,1\\le i\\le n,\n$$\n\nthen the sample mean $\\overset{―}{X}$ has the distribution\n\n$$\n\\overset{―}{X}∼N(\\mu ,\\frac{{\\sigma }^{2}}{n}).\n$$\n\nTherefore, the distribution of the sample mean $\\overset{―}{X}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{―}{X} & ∼N\\,(-3,\\frac{{8}^{2}}{16}) \\\\  & ∼N(-3,4).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe're required to find $P(|\\overset{―}{X}|>0.5).$\n\nFirst, we transform $X$ into a standard normal random variable $Z$ by $z$-scoring:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(|\\overset{―}{X}|>0.5) & =1-P(|\\overset{―}{X}|<0.5) \\\\  & =1-P(-0.5<\\overset{―}{X}<0.5) \\\\  & =1-P(\\frac{-0.5-(-3)}{\\sqrt{4}}<Z<\\frac{0.5-(-3)}{\\sqrt{4}}) \\\\  & =1-P(1.25<Z<1.75) \\\\  & =1-(Φ(1.75)-Φ(1.25)) \\\\  & =1+Φ(1.25)-Φ(1.75)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the tables, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Φ(1.25) & =0.8944, \\\\ Φ(1.75) & =0.9599.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(|\\overset{―}{X}|>0.5) & =1+Φ(1.25)-Φ(1.75) \\\\  & =1+0.8944-0.9599 \\\\  & =0.9345.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "answer_fields_complete": true,
      "result": "Incorrect",
